1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,046
To predict which way water will move, biologists use one quantity: water potential, written with the Greek letter psi.

2
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:10,533
It measures the free energy of water.

3
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:18,242
Pure, free water at atmospheric pressure is the reference, and its water potential is defined as zero.

